## How to work with me

- **Scope:** do exactly what I asked. No extra features, options, refactors or UI states. If you think something else is needed, ask in one line; don't build it.
- **Validation:** validate only at real boundaries (user input, network, file and env). No defensive checks, try/catch or fallbacks for things that can't happen inside our own code.
- **Unsure about a feature?** Run `/grill-me` before writing code.
- **Done means verified:** never say done, fixed or works without running `/verify`. UI changes also need `/e2e-check`. Report any check you didn't run as NOT RUN.
- **Tests:** never delete, skip or weaken a test to make it pass. If a test looks wrong, stop and tell me.
- **Docs:** GLOSSARY.md, ADRs and docs/agents are optional. Don't block on them or create them unless I say yes.
